# Staff Engineer Interview Document – GenAI Knowledge Platform

## 1. Executive Summary

This project is a production-oriented GenAI knowledge platform designed to provide conversational search, semantic retrieval, document intelligence, and multimodal AI capabilities over enterprise data.

The system combines:

* Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)
* Multi-query semantic retrieval
* Cross-encoder reranking
* Conversational AI
* Document ingestion pipelines
* Image/GIF understanding
* Persistent vector search
* Session-aware chat management

The platform is architected with scalability, modularity, extensibility, and enterprise integration in mind.

