# 18. Sample Staff Engineer Interview Questions & Answers

## Q1. Why did you choose multi-query retrieval?

Answer:

Single-query vector search often misses semantically related content due to embedding limitations. Multi-query retrieval improves recall by generating alternate semantic formulations of the same query, increasing the probability of retrieving relevant chunks.

---

## Q2. Why use cross-encoder reranking?

Answer:

Embedding similarity provides approximate semantic matching but lacks precise relevance scoring. Cross-encoders directly evaluate query-document pairs, significantly improving retrieval precision and reducing noisy context.

---

